  base-thickness floor (non-pressure): post-bond flatness machining 0.10-0.20 mm + erosion/corrosion allowance 0.10 mm + etch/skive tolerance 0.05 mm
  -> 0.8 mm finished (1.0 mm as-bonded) is the practical minimum; pressure alone would allow < 0.5 mm.

